ions, that's all."],"jaJP":["仲間がやられてしまいそうだっていうのに、ジっとなんかしてられなかっただけよ"]},"keys":["cv_maam_CoopMVP"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/503/5030027"]},"audioName":"5030027"},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["我也是会拼上性命战斗的，如果是为了正义而战就更是如此！"],"enUS":["Even I can risk my life in battle. Even more so, if it's for justice!"],"jaJP":["私も命を懸けて戦うわ、正義のための戦いなら尚更よ！"]},"keys":["cv_maam_CoopHi"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/503/5030028"]},"audioName":"5030028"},{"type":"CoopHurryUp","label":"战斗-急迫","texts":{"zhCN":["抓紧时间！"],"enUS":["Hurry!"],"jaJP":["急いで！"]},"keys":["cv_maam_CoopHurryUp"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/503/5030029"]},"audioName":"5030029"},{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["别担心。只要还没死，就不算输！"],"enUS":["Don't worry. So long as you survive, you haven't lost!"],"jaJP":["心配しないで、死ななければ、負けじゃないわ！"]},"keys":["cv_maam_CoopBelieve"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/503/5030030"]},"audioName":"5030030"},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["喜、喜欢我…突然在这种地方告诉我…？！"],"enUS":["W-What do you mean you like me… Why are you saying that all of a sudden…?!"],"jaJP":["…そ、そんなこと、今…こんな所で急に言われても…困るわ…！！"]},"keys":["Voice_maam_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_maam_TouchReactionGood1"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/503/5030031"]},"audioName":"5030031"},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["你…就像是需要照顾的家人，真的让我很在意。"],"enUS":["I'm always afraid to let you out of my sight. You're like a little brother."],"jaJP":["あなたは…手のかかる家族みたいな感じで、やっぱり気になるわ…"]},"keys":["Voice_maam_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_maam_TouchReactionGood2"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/503/5030032"]},"audioName":"5030032"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["拥有着必须去守护的重要之人，不是只有你而已！"],"enUS":["I also have preciou